{"x":7,"y":5,"captures":[[{"rule":0,"flash":[],"flips":[]}]],"p1s":6,"p2s":4,"eb":-1,"z":"red/2c6f2d4124715833525953582c385b40436b7044526921586e2f405f79","u":1,"c":"12","dialog":[[],[{"buttons":[{"name":"Thanks!","direction":1}],"content":"<p>When card ranks are increased or decreased with the Elemental rule, only the Basic rule recognizes those changes. The Same, Plus and Combo rules will still evaluate the original card ranks.</p><p>Thanks for listening and good luck. Kupo!</p>"}]],"gameover":[]}
